                <pb facs="0829" n="753" sameAs="frus:frus1935v02/pg753"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5431/192: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bern</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-06-10T11:00:00+01:00">June 10, 1935—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 12(<hi rendition="#italic">10?</hi>)—4:54
                        a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>25. After Stucki’s visit has terminated I would appreciate it if you would cable
                    me a brief summary of what happened which I may have in my possession before his
                    arrival in Berne.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
